media: ipu-bridge: Report the XPS 14 DA14260 camera as upside down

The OV08X40 (OVTI08F4) on the Dell XPS 14 DA14260 is mounted upside down,
but neither the SSDB nor the _PLD reports a rotation of 180 degrees.

---
--- a/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu-bridge.c	2026-10-14 21:23:22.870184010 +0100
+++ b/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu-bridge.c	2026-10-14 21:23:41.942606354 +0100
@@ -134,6 +134,13 @@
 		},
 		.driver_data = "OVTI02C1",
 	},
+	{
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_SYS_VENDOR, "Dell Inc."),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_NAME, "XPS 14 DA14260"),
+		},
+		.driver_data = "OVTI08F4",
+	},
 	{} /* Terminating entry */
 };
 
